###

### Get All Tests
GET http://localhost:8000/test/all

###

### Get Only Active Tests (auto-disables expired tests after 24 hrs)
GET http://localhost:8000/test/active

###

### Get Test by ID
GET http://localhost:8000/test/get_by_test_id/7fb99966-8e32-4481-9f54-50bcf7e33e50

###

### Update Test (Add MCQ & Coding Test IDs)
PUT http://localhost:8000/test/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "test_id": "b913cdf9-79ff-4745-a57b-0a5882253dd2",
  "mcq_id": ["5822a799-2a0e-4c14-90df-f25f72ef5d0e"],
  "coding_test_id": ["coding_id-5", "coding_id-6"]
}

###

### Toggle Test Status to ACTIVE (sets activeAt timestamp)
PUT http://localhost:8000/test/toggle_status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "test_id": "1b5318ce-feb7-462c-a97e-565e7bc0576f",
  "status": "disabled"
}

###

### Toggle Test Status to DISABLED (clears activeAt)
PUT http://localhost:8000/test/toggle_status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "test_id": "b913cdf9-79ff-4745-a57b-0a5882253dd2",
  "status": "disabled"
}

###

### Delete Test
DELETE http://localhost:8000/test/delete/11571180-691a-4b62-b126-43e000b98479

###

### Remove MCQ from Test
PUT http://localhost:8000/test/remove_mcq_from_test
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "test_id": "11571180-691a-4b62-b126-43e000b98479",
  "mcq_id": "d3d88451-7419-4bcd-ae0c-d04e515b2546"
}
